@baseUrl = http://localhost:5001
@contrasena = Chrono2026!

### Login admin
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{baseUrl}}/usuarios/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@chronosalud.demo",
  "contrasena": "{{contrasena}}"
}

###
@token = {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.token}}

### Ver pacientes y sus ids
GET {{baseUrl}}/pacientes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### A - Cargar DNI a Duarte (cambiá el 1 por el id real)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/pacientes/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dni": "30111222"
}

### B - Cargar DNI a Salas
PUT {{baseUrl}}/pacientes/2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dni": "28999888"
}

### C - Duplicado: mismo DNI de Duarte en Salas -> 409
PUT {{baseUrl}}/pacientes/2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dni": "30111222"
}

### D - Borrar DNI de Duarte -> 200 y queda null
PUT {{baseUrl}}/pacientes/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dni": ""
}

### D2 - Confirmar que quedó null
GET {{baseUrl}}/pacientes/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### E - Filtro parcial (volvé a cargar el DNI en A antes)
GET {{baseUrl}}/pacientes?dni=3011
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}